menu "Chess user button"

    config CHESS_GESTURE_BUTTON
        bool "V2 hall PCB gesture button (lamp, pair, new game, off)"
        depends on CHESS_MATRIX_INPUT_I2C_HALL
        default n
        help
            SW1 "tlacitko nova hra" on the czechmate hall PCB.
            Active-low, external 10 kΩ to 3V3. Enable only on that board.
            The reed devkit keeps the GPIO15 reset button.

    config CHESS_GESTURE_BUTTON_GPIO
        int "Gesture button GPIO"
        depends on CHESS_GESTURE_BUTTON
        range 0 30
        default 23
        help
            czechmate_CH224A schematic: SW1 / NEWGAME_SWITCH on ESP32-C6 IO23.
            Do not set this to GPIO15 on the reed image.

endmenu
